DECISIONS 339, CODEGEN.md §2.1: `open` of a go emit needs mode types; the default mode baked and a written data mode are both refused (`openMode`).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A destination.
enum Dst { str, sta }

emit go { out: "@sovcommon/a", open: [Dst] }
-- b/b.canon --
package b

/// A destination.
enum Dst { str, sta }

emit go { out: "@sovcommon/b", mode: data, open: [Dst] }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8009]  a/a.canon:6:32
  open of emit go needs mode types, not baked

error[E8009]  b/b.canon:6:44
  open of emit go needs mode types, not data

2 errors, 0 warnings in 2 packages (…)
